---
component: soothe
effects: true
params:
  who: speaker
  bed: { type: { entity: fixture } }
  tune: { type: string, default: "You hum the lullaby from the tape, badly." }
beat:
  on: examine
  target: "fixture.@bed"
  priority: 10
  spentBy: "holds('calmed', [@who])"
---

## Soothe
/* A patient in the isolation wing waits for the round. Settling one is the
same three moves every time: the patient's own words (the beat body), the
tune, and the bed going still. */
::body
@narrator: {{@tune}}
@narrator: The breathing under the sheet slows, and stops, and does not start again.
::assert{calmed(@who)}
::set{run.hush += 1}
